  "id": "coriander-relish",
  "name": "Coriander Relish",
  "subtitle": "A fresh, bright green herb relish",
  "description": "Blend coriander, mint, apple, chilli, ginger, garlic, cumin, sugar, lime, and soaked cashews into a smooth Indian-style relish.",
